6. activate_origin_node origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
7. lock_origin_availability origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha

After lock, we have origin_availability_locked and origin_availability_confirmed.

Similarly for destination availability:
