Similarly for loading container: we have two containers, each linked to a specific schedule candidate. So fine.

Equipment resources: we have two, each schedule candidate may need one.

Skill certificate: only one, but schedule candidates each need skill certificate assigned. We have only one skill_certificate_alpha. So we need to assign to one candidate, then release, then assign to the other.

