Step37: assign_compliance_certificate SA CCA
Step38: apply_operational_constraint SA OCA RTP
Step39: confirm_operator_alignment SA OP
Step40: verify_compliance_certificate SA CCA
Step41: release_compliance_certificate SA CCA   // after verification
Step42: release_operator_resource SA OP
Step43: finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation SA
Step44: // now we have dispatch_ready SA and candidate_finalized SA
Step45: // we need task profile linked for allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate; we still have it attached (step34). Good.
Step46: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate SA DS RTP
Step47: execute_schedule_dispatch SA VA DS

After execute, SA dispatched, vehicle VA available, dispatch slot available.

Now we need to detach SA's task profile (optional) before reusing for SB.

Step48: detach_task_profile SA RTP

Now prepare SB:

Step49: allocate_vehicle_unit SB VG
Step50: attach_task_profile SB RTP
Step51: confirm_candidate_preparedness SB RTP
Step52: assign_operator_resource SB OP
Step53: assign_compliance_certificate SB CCA
Step54: apply_operational_constraint SB OCB RTP
Step55: confirm_operator_alignment SB OP
Step56: verify_compliance_certificate SB CCA
Step57: release_compliance_certificate SB CCA
Step58: release_operator_resource SB OP
Step59: finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation SB
Step60: // task profile still linked
Step61: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate SB DS RTP
Step62: execute_schedule_dispatch SB VG DS

After this, all four dispatched.

Now we need to verify that we didn't miss any needed predicates like candidate_vehicle_linked for dispatch actions: execute_origin_dispatch requires candidate_vehicle_linked ?origin_availability ?vehicle_unit. We set that via allocate_vehicle_unit. Good.

Execute_destination_dispatch similarly.

Execute_schedule_dispatch requires candidate_vehicle_linked ?candidate ?vehicle_unit. We set via allocate_vehicle_unit.

Now we need to ensure that after allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate we have candidate_dispatch_slot_linked set, which is needed for execute_*_dispatch. Yes.

Now we need to ensure that we haven't violated any negative preconditions like not (dispatched ?candidate) before dispatch. We ensured we haven't dispatched yet.

Now we need to ensure that we didn't accidentally leave any candidate with dispatch_allocated true after we dispatched? Not a problem.

Now we need to check that we didn't violate any precondition like (not (candidate_created ?candidate)) for create_candidate: we only called create once each.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to allocate vehicle to a candidate that already has vehicle_allocated. We allocated only once each.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to attach_task_profile when it's already linked (we detached before reattaching). Good.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to assign_operator_resource when operator not available: we released before each assign.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to assign_compliance_certificate when not available: we released after each use.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to apply_operational_constraint when not available: each constraint is used only once.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to verify_compliance_certificate when compliance_validation_complete already true: we called verify before finalize, and after verify we released compliance certificate but not the validation complete predicate. finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation requires compliance_validation_complete ?candidate (true after verify) and not candidate_finalized. So good.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation after candidate already finalized (we didn't).

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate when dispatch_allocated already true: we allocated before dispatch, and after dispatch we didn't allocate again.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to execute_*_dispatch when not dispatch_allocated: we allocated before.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to execute_*_dispatch when already dispatched: we checked not dispatched precondition.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready when already dispatch_ready: we checked not dispatch_ready.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready when already dispatch_ready: same.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to assemble_transport_leg when transport_leg not available: we used it once.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to authorize_transport_leg_loading when not authorized: we did after assemble.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready when origin_availability_locked and confirmed etc: we had those.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready when destination_availability_locked and confirmed: we had those.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to activate_origin_node when origin_node_ready already true: we activated before lock, and node was not ready.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to activate_destination_node when destination_node_ready already true: we activated before lock.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to lock_origin_availability when origin_availability_locked already true: we locked before loading, and after lock we didn't lock again.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to lock_destination_availability when destination_availability_locked already true: same.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to assign_operator_resource when candidate already operator linked: we released before each assign.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to assign_compliance_certificate when candidate already compliance certificate linked: we released before each assign.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to apply_operational_constraint when constraint already applied: we applied once each.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to confirm_operator_alignment when already confirmed: we did after apply.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to verify_compliance_certificate when compliance_validation_complete already true: we did before finalize.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation when candidate_finalized already true: we did before.

Now we need to ensure we didn't try to allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate when dispatch_allocated already true: we allocated before dispatch.

